WEBVTT

00:03:58.998 --> 00:04:00.920
It makes it worse, the fire spreads.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:04.917
Our whole culture gets burned.

00:04:04.917 --> 00:04:08.050
If what gets the most clicks wins,

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:10.921
then we have to start shaping the world we want

00:04:10.921 --> 00:04:12.890
with our clicks,

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:16.776
because clicking is a public act.

00:04:16.776 --> 00:04:19.256
So click responsibly. Thank you.

00:04:19.256 --> 00:04:23.256
(Applause)